PART 0 -- THE GUARD.  CLASS DECLARED, TESTED AGAINST MEMBERS IT HAS NOT SEEN
==============================================================================
CLASS CLAIMED: any COST EVALUATOR that mis-states what a frame extension costs
  (under- or over-counting the dodge list, or paying one less than the proof
  demands), and any QUANTIFIER-SCOPE defect that widens the legal set of frames.
GUARD: every firing must BUILD the induced anchored path and survive a checker
  built from the EDGE LIST, not from the adjacency sets the frame walk uses.
UNSEEN MEMBERS (none is zero-step / one-step / late-block / off-by-one-search /
  anchor-drift -- the five members r34..r37 tested):
    (D1) COST-UNDERCOUNT  -- dodge list counted over half the indices
    (D2) COST-OFFBYONE    -- pays 1+k where the proof demands 2+k
    (D3) HOME-BLIND       -- y allowed to range over u_{d-1}'s OWN component

