THE THRESHOLD IS PART OF THE GUARD (r37's finding, re-measured here):
  an over-permissive cost defect is INVISIBLE at a frame that extends anyway --
  the INVISIBLE column counts exactly those.  A guard scored only where it fires
  cannot see them, which is why the extra/caught split is printed separately.

